{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52524","headline":"平獠宴喜 · 陈元光","name":"平獠宴喜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉钤森万骑，金鼓肃羣雄。\n扫穴三苗窜，旋车百粤空。\n风生云无帐，雪压碧油[幢]（憧）。\n火烈消穷北，呈祥应岁东。\n朝端张孝友，炮鳖待元戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}